      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean yeah i know it could be something else but i've had a migraine like this before where my vision went all fuzzy and i felt shaky. plus i dont have any real pain in my chest or anything, it's just the arm and the head. do you think it's worth the wait to see if it passes? i'm trying to avoid the hospital if i can just rest it off.",
